<title>ESTONIA: BALTICS-HOIU GOES TO LATVIA THROUGH SUBSIDIARIES.</title>
<headline>BALTICS-HOIU GOES TO LATVIA THROUGH SUBSIDIARIES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Hoiupank is going to enter the Latvian market through its subsidiaries, the bank's vice chairman of the board, Priit Haller, said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are certainly going to develop our activities in Latvia,&quot; Haller said at a news conference.</p>
<p>Hoiupank plans to enter Latvia through subsidiaries, such as brokers and leasing, he added.</p>
<p>Hoiupank, which is the second largest bank in Estonia, said earlier that it wanted to begin operations in Lithuania this summer.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
